                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1a1e3786-d196-3ba1-a334-299a6dfae9fe",
                        "entry_id": "297d4c36-e0df-3acc-a393-032ab808f531",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An undefined value."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "53ae43e1-3a14-48db-b86f-178c20e4c764",
                                "sense_id": "1a1e3786-d196-3ba1-a334-299a6dfae9fe",
                                "text": "[Option:] · [PDP11:] F [BSD:] · [XE 2.3:] [1] [XE 3.0:] · [SIII:] · [COFF:] · [meaning:] make undefineds global"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4e4784e8-0ffe-4377-b6f4-34faf685ced0",
                                "sense_id": "1a1e3786-d196-3ba1-a334-299a6dfae9fe",
                                "text": "Every operation is defined completely either by delivering a value of some type depending only on the types of its operands or by causing some defined exception; there are no ‘undefineds’ in Ten15."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3d1de764-b90d-4344-a4b4-0204d130420b",
                                "sense_id": "1a1e3786-d196-3ba1-a334-299a6dfae9fe",
                                "text": "The Array object has these commonly-used properties: • .length: the number of items including undefineds."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            }
        ],
        "ru-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "dd70f60c-c88f-3afa-ad4c-c84d90bab4d3",
                "word": "undefined",
                "pos": "adj",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a995e81f-c117-3370-b04c-447b7d7e16b3",
                        "entry_id": "dd70f60c-c88f-3afa-ad4c-c84d90bab4d3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "неопределённый, неясный"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e1f6217c-aaa5-4928-b1d7-23e76bb0efc4",
                                "sense_id": "a995e81f-c117-3370-b04c-447b7d7e16b3",
                                "text": "Obama sent troops to fight undefined mission in Afghanistan"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3d45a62a-7cb7-4526-81ce-6024061ebb92",
                                "sense_id": "a995e81f-c117-3370-b04c-447b7d7e16b3",
                                "text": "And whereas the wants of the Californians were nebulous and undefined, the wants of the Okies were beside the roads, lying there to be seen and coveted: the good fields with water to be dug for, the good green fields, earth to crumble experimentally in the hand, grass to smell, oaten stalks to chew until the sharp sweetness was in the throat.",
                                "translation": "И тогда как требования калифорнийцев были туманны и неопределённы, требования Оки отличались реальностью: все то, к чему они стремились, лежало тут же у дороги, дразня глаз, разжигая зависть."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a0bcc72f-10db-3fc2-b26c-024616c0d863",
                        "entry_id": "dd70f60c-c88f-3afa-ad4c-c84d90bab4d3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "матем. неопределённый"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c62e73bd-c1a2-4b20-b3bc-9f3744d328f7",
                                "sense_id": "a0bcc72f-10db-3fc2-b26c-024616c0d863",
                                "text": "Two of the most famous examples are that division by zero and zero to the power of zero are both undefined."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5a8f0b9c-3e9a-385f-b7dc-ffd8e6e9477b",
                        "entry_id": "dd70f60c-c88f-3afa-ad4c-c84d90bab4d3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "комп. неопределённый"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "17aa5cde-b4b0-4dd3-b7b7-3929b5c0f5ae",
                                "sense_id": "5a8f0b9c-3e9a-385f-b7dc-ffd8e6e9477b",
                                "text": "In computing (particularly, in programming), undefined value is a condition where an expression does not have a correct value, although it is syntactically correct."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
